  With no data to send, `tcp_rexmit()` (tcp_appsend.c:325-329) turns that into a pure ACK: `tcp_send(dev, conn, TCP_ACK, hdrlen);`. If neither data nor `TCP_SNDACK`, it does `dev->d_len = 0;` (tcp_appsend.c:333-336) and the poll produces nothing.

